               "text": "#### Practicing Addition with Chosen Numbers\n\nChoose the numbers and click Start. Then, in each column, type the digit that stays in the result row and, when the sum reaches ten, type 1 in the carry box above the next order.\n\nType two numbers between 0 and 99999.",
